  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA country program ( support for SRHR and Youth)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall goal for UNFPA Country Programme will be implemented 2020-2024 and this support is for Outcome 1 on Sexual and reproductive health, and outcome 2 on adolescents and youth to ensure that youth are empowered and can advocate for their rights including improving their bodily autonomy. The programme will be implemented in close collaboration with the Congolese Government, civil society, and private-sector partners at national and subnational levels, with a geographic and programmatic focus.</narrative>
  </description>
